<title>UK: INSIGHT-Cocoa seen supported at 1,000 stg.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Cocoa seen supported at 1,000 stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SEPT	Close  * Support * Resist * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA40</p>
<p> COCOA     1,043  *  1,000  *  1,052 *   41  *  1,097 *  1,069</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - JULY 9----------------</p>
<p>Cocoa futures are likely to continue to move sideways after recent sharp falls, with the market finding good support at 1,000 stg a tonne basis September, technical analysts said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Traders called the market to open one stg up.</p>
</text>
